WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:33.570
Once upon a time, a queen
ruled over a beautiful country,

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:36.900
but she was taken captive by a fearsome monster.

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:46.040
Without the queen, all the light
and greenery in the country faded away.

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:48.500
The people mourned her.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:55.260
But at that time, a lone hero appeared.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:02:02.090
The hero bravely fought the monster,
 but it turned out to be far too powerful.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:14.690
However, a single tear shed by the hero
 called forth a shining fruit from the heavens,

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:18.360
and it bestowed the hero with great power and bravery.

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:20.330
The fruit of Ide...

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:22.040
The light of Ide...

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.640
The infinite power of Ide  was on the hero's side.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.210
The hero rescued the beautiful queen,

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:35.920
and they ruled the beautiful land
 with their benevolent powers.

00:02:38.530 --> 00:02:42.620
Does the Ide spoken of in the 
Buff Clan's legend really exist?

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:49.930
Doesn't that "Logo Dau" planet
 look exactly like our homeworld?

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:52.060
Lady Karala!

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.100
Where are you headed?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.780
I'm going to investigate Logo Dau.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:57.070
Lady Karala!

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.190
Shiraku, cut him off.

00:02:58.270 --> 00:02:58.650
Yes.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:02:59.150
Karala...

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.660
Please stay seated.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.740
Take off.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:05.200
Yes.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:15.750
<b>The Legend Lives Again</b>

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:25.800
If Cosmo and Deck are in such a hurry, something
 must have happened at the excavation site!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.070
We hope you had a pleasant 
journey. This is Planet Solo.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.400
You're at New Lopia Airport.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.260
You have arrived at the landing site.

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:46.210
Be careful. You may use auto-landing.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.120
New Lopia's going to have more women now.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:54.250
It's starting to feel like a real town. Isn't that great?

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.670
The third immigration ship with three
hundred families is finally here.

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.970
If you people get involved, our research
 into the Sixth Civilization will be ruined!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.340
This giant vehicle needs to be
 brought over to the military.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.010
No way...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.140
Wow, you built this thing?

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:13.850
The military will be seizing it.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.190
We didn't build this.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.230
It's a relic of the Sixth Civilization.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:19.520
We restored it.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:21.860
A relic?

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:35.210
However, Bes... What Sheryl just said was true.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:35.920
But...

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.420
You bitch!

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.760
My name is Sheryl Formossa!

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.590
But Planet Solo doesn't have any intelligent life.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.390
That's why we started colonization two years ago!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.430
Those things can't be relics!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:51.140
Shut up!

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:55.500
This is my father's workplace!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:56.140
Cosmo!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.940
Don't interfere in adult conversation.

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.450
Do you think Bes is behaving like an adult?!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:02.190
Cosmo!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.360
Cosmo is just telling the truth.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.510
Are there really aliens here?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.040
Who knows, that's what we're going to find out.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:18.880
Milady!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:35.730
It's the aliens...

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.230
Is something the matter, milady?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:39.730
Huh?

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.360
We've discovered them at last.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:45.740
Let's go.

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:47.400
Milady...

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:55.500
That Shiraku, she shook us off!

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:56.960
There's a radar!

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.370
What, does it belong to aliens?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:05:59.250
Possibly.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:10.800
Hey! Is that an immigrant's airplane?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:18.940
Those fools!

00:06:19.660 --> 00:06:21.620
We don't even know how powerful the aliens are yet!

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:23.900
Milady!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.990
Don't forget to record this.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:27.490
Yes.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:30.740
Why'd you shoot?!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:33.070
Lady Karala landed somewhere around there!

00:06:33.070 --> 00:06:37.410
If something were to happen to Lady Karala,
we could be reduced to slaves!

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.410
Father!

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.460
Run, Cosmo!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:40.870
Hey!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:42.350
Deck! Get up!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.910
Hide in the jungle!

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:47.110
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.220
And abandon these relics?

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.300
You're on your own then!

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.350
Damn you!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:02.310
Deck!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:03.860
Head to the building on your left!

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:07.780
What are these?

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:09.690
What was that tremor?!

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:14.240
Dr. Formossa! Are these machines also relics?

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:15.490
Yes.

00:07:17.690 --> 00:07:19.040
What's going on here?

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.040
I don't know.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.460
Those flying saucers just suddenly...

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.330
Deck! Stand back!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:39.390
You'll die too!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:40.810
Deck!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.770
Where are Lady Karala and Mayaya's Gadakkas?

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.410
Are these the relics?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.280
Like I'd know!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:04.250
My dad told me not to come see him,
 and said he was just researching fossils...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.000
The screen turned on!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.460
Cosmo!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:10.670
Go!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.300
It's moving!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:18.350
Ms. Sheryl!

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.560
Does this thing move?

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.180
They're coming!

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:25.400
We can flee to New Lopia with this!

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:29.940
We installed this panel and control system 
on our own, they're not ready yet...

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.540
As long as it can move!

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.240
Cosmo!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:40.950
Shut up!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:41.910
Be quiet!

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.000
I can't believe it...

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.630
After taking all those hits, it's still undamaged.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.880
This is one incredible machine, isn't it?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:08:59.720
What the?

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:01.560
What's going on?

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.330
It stopped!

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:26.540
For what reason?

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.120
C'mon, move!

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.380
What happened?

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:34.610
Beats me...

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.360
Hey, look at the monitor on your left!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:39.580
A human shape?

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.930
Is it related to this mechanism?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:43.390
That's it!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.100
This is what they meant by the "Giant"!

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:46.560
Huh?

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.360
Is that a weapon of theirs?

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.240
It isn't the Legendary Giant, is it?

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:57.450
Don't be stupid!

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:09.740
The arm-like part is moving!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:11.710
Okay, let's swing it!

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:21.430
Gaseba's Copola!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:22.600
Yes!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.980
Alright, let's get this robot to stand up and fight!

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.490
A giant?

00:10:37.590 --> 00:10:38.780
The hero of Ide?

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:40.240
Looks like it's standing up!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:41.660
Alright, let's punch!

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:42.860
We'll crush them with a punch!

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:04.550
That power...

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:06.890
It might be the hero of the legend!

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.020
That power!

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:08.730
Mayaya!

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:14.110
The legendary giant would shine more radiantly...

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.240
What have we done?!

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.660
Shiraku and Gaseba's Copola squads
have been completely destroyed?

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:28.850
It's data from the unmanned research probes!

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:30.040
No doubt about it!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:30.750
Gil Baus!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:31.500
Dekka Baus!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:32.420
Prepare to launch!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:32.750
Yes sir!

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.420
What about Lady Karala?

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.710
Oh, I don't know.

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:37.220
This turned into something terrible.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.130
Are the aliens on Logo Dau that advanced?

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:41.340
They aren't, that's why she left!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.840
Prepare to launch, quickly!

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.250
Weren't there supposed to be
 relics other than this one?

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.000
Do you mean the vehicles from
 the second excavation site?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.270
Aren't they related to this machine?

00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.240
Have you gotten in touch with the military yet?

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:27.430
We tried, but there's a lot of radio interference.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:30.220
Evacuate all the civilians to that vehicle.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:31.780
I'll guide them.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:34.960
Alright. Call an engineer, we need
 to examine this machine.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.650
You'll offer us the needed data, right?

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.480
You were riding this thing?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.030
Cosmo controlled it.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:43.960
No way!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.860
It's you again.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.440
Did you really control it?

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:48.280
I tried to.

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.160
Well, until we get a real pilot, you'll do fine.

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.830
But Cosmo, were you able to do it?

00:12:53.100 --> 00:12:56.790
Yeah, but I think it started moving on
 its own, after that thing turned on.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.550
The Ideon Gauge, that's what you said, right?

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:05.340
The symbols resemble Greek letters, but
they're not read the same way...

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:07.840
Joliver, take care of the rest.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.680
Oh, I brought a battle suit for Cosmo too.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.220
I have to wear a battle suit?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.310
I wonder what that blast was.

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.940
They're probably clearing the jungle.

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.350
Watch out.

00:13:23.370 --> 00:13:24.200
Thank you, Lin.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:24.990
Don't mention it.

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:27.030
Lou, that's hot, don't touch it.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:31.700
Lou, this one's yours, see?

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.160
It's lunchtime, come and get it!

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:37.870
It's time to eat!

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:40.790
Piper Lou, what's wrong?

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:43.670
What is it, Lou?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.800
Settle down.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.850
You've got food all over your face.

00:13:46.940 --> 00:13:49.260
What's wrong? Oh, Lou.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.050
I wonder what that siren is for...

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:59.730
Sir Gije's unit is approaching them first.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.590
Gije, you'd better handle this properly!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.610
Lou, it's dangerous here.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:16.410
What about you?

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.160
I'm going see what's happening in New Lopia.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.830
Lotta, take shelter in the forest.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.330
Yes!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:23.170
Be careful.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:24.250
You too, ma'am!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:30.930
They're here!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:31.220
Yeah!

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.720
What kind of aliens are these?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.520
Deck! Is it okay to ride that thing?

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.440
It's alright!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.310
Cosmo is driving it!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.400
This thing seems pretty sturdy! Get on, Lotta!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.070
Okay, we'll do that!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.610
Everyone, get on!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.040
We can go!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.720
Once we leave this forest, there's
a place where we can take shelter.

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.100
Please have a little more patience.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.850
You managed to get here all by yourself?

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:21.480
Get on.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:25.770
Hurry and go!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:30.700
The enemy is coming before us.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.740
All units, concentrate your fire on it!

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.170
A flying giant on Logo Dau?

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.460
Get Lou to stop crying!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:46.540
Don't yell like that, it's only
 going to make things worse!

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:47.670
I've got some candy.

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:48.500
Thanks.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:49.590
Here, Lou.

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.220
Is it good?

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:07.060
It's undamaged? That monster's undamaged?!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.490
We need to ascend!

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.110
Ideon, rise up!

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.490
Don't make Lou cry!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.370
All civilians, get inside the ship!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.410
Military personnel, stay outside
 and protect the entrance!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.750
All civilians, get inside the ship!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.750
Soldiers, guard the entrance!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.130
I knew it, the size of this deck-like part...

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.680
It's big enough to carry that robot!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.690
Sir Damido!

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.860
Gije's squadron has come in contact with the Giant!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.400
The Giant?!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:52.820
Yes!

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:54.450
The Legendary Giant?

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:56.360
The Legendary Hero...

00:16:56.520 --> 00:16:57.960
It's here on this planet?!

00:17:03.250 --> 00:17:04.160
It's a spaceship!

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.580
Do you mean this thing can launch?

00:17:07.690 --> 00:17:09.040
We're in the middle of investigating it.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.630
All hands, load all the guns and missiles!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:15.470
Load all the guns and missiles!

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:18.550
Are there any injured people here?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:23.060
Can this ship really move?

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.310
No doubt about it, go ahead and test it.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:29.230
I don't understand.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.480
If this was built by the Logo Dau
 aliens, why did they bury it here?

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.490
Hey, you!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:41.120
This place is off limits for non-authorized personnel.

00:17:43.870 --> 00:17:45.290
Are you one of the third generation immigrants?

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.500
Please stay near the entrance.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.250
There's an Ideon Gauge in here, too!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:51.790
Yeah.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:53.710
Ideon?

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.010
Damido, please!

00:18:03.150 --> 00:18:04.400
The Giant is powerful!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:05.470
All right!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:07.810
I'll test my Gil Bau strategy!

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.270
They want a close range fight?

00:18:30.520 --> 00:18:32.940
What's with these childish tactics?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:35.460
Don't make Lou cry!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.550
Cosmo, don't say that.

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.820
It's just natural to be afraid in a situtation like this.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.390
Missiles, fire!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:54.980
Attack the eye!

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.940
The control center should be located there!

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:58.360
Yes!

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.990
I can't control it!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.040
We're getting beaten!

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.160
The controls aren't working!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.750
That means we should...

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.250
Cut the engine!

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.750
Stop all engines!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.130
Stop the engines!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:25.760
We're falling!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:35.650
We're gonna fall!

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.950
Cosmo! It's okay!

00:19:44.570 --> 00:19:45.740
Make him stop crying!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.580
It's distracting!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.020
We hit them!

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:21.570
Sir Damido!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.410
How can this be happening?!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.410
The hero of Ide, it can't be!

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.660
No, it can't be!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:40.210
It's coming up from the ground!

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.440
It's moving! A spaceship?

00:20:58.900 --> 00:20:59.900
Lou...

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:04.530
Joliver!

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.160
You got the main engine working?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.450
I don't know.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.120
We're still adjusting it.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.160
What?

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:13.450
Then, how did this ship move?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.710
Sheryl, what are you hiding from us?

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.250
I'm not hiding anything.

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.880
I told you everything!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.550
Out of all places...

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.970
Why did that spaceship come out of the ground?!

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.190
What is this?!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.700
Damn aliens!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.830
They're using an antimatter engine!

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:56.460
Sir Damido!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:58.250
Are they escaping?!

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.660
Inside that ship, Lady Karala...

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.060
Could she be in there?

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:29.530
After avoiding the attack of the Buff Clan aliens,

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:34.990
Cosmo and the others have set off to space
 with the Sixth Civilization relic, Solo Ship.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:42.080
Using their subspace drive, they
 begun to flee from galaxy to galaxy.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:53.720
<i>The Solo Ship receives an emergency communication.</i>

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:57.390
<i>The colony planet Caral has  been attacked by aliens.</i>

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:02.190
<i>However, it turns out to be a plan
 by the Buff Clan to lure out the Ideon.</i>

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:08.990
<i>The Buff Clan's new forces appear before Cosmo,
 along with a powerful Heavy Mobile Mecha.</i>

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:15.030
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
"The Shocking Decoy Planet."</i>

